# Magikos session packages for adoption of an existing Artix OpenRC system.
# Curated from magikos-base.packages (plus the PipeWire packages normally in
# magikos-other.packages). Use the host's configured Artix repos; do not add
# Arch/CachyOS repositories or replace its bootloader, kernel, initramfs, GPU
# drivers, microcode, display manager, or existing seat manager.
#
# Omitted: cachyos-*, cachy-update, chwd, linux-cachyos*, linux-omarchy*,
# mkinitcpio, efibootmgr, os-prober, and AUR/vendor-only extras (e.g. yay,
# bpftune-git, brave-origin-bin, topgrade-bin). uwsm requires systemd's user
# manager; it cannot provide the OpenRC Sway session. Do not pull in unverified
# screenshot editors such as swappy/satty: grim and slurp are available in
# Artix world, and flameshot is available there for the legacy power menu.
# sddm and other login manager, network manager, firewall, and power-profile service packages
# are left to the host's existing setup; adopting a desktop must not change
# the system's login, network, firewall, or power policy. Installing service scripts
# does not enable them. PipeWire PulseAudio compatibility is opt-in because
# it can conflict with an existing PulseAudio service on an adopted system.

alsa-plugins
alsa-utils
bash-completion
bluez
bluez-openrc
bluez-utils
